  "brief": {
    "story": "Four NAND gates in one black package: a 74HC00. Someone wired its gate 1 to two switches and an LED, and it does nothing at all, whatever the switches do. The chip isn't broken.",
    "goal": "Make LED1 follow NAND of SA and SB (dark only when both are on) using IC1's gate 1.",
